    "title": "EC2",
    "body": "<h1 data-section-id=\"yz7qma\" data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"175\">EC2 Cost Optimization – Practical Guide</h1><h2 data-section-id=\"mw187i\" data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"209\">1. Right-Sizing (Highest ROI)</h2><p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"264\"><strong data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"222\">Problem:</strong> Over-provisioned instances waste CPU/RAM.</p><p data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"279\"><strong data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"279\">Approach:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"425\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1384wrw\" data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"339\">\nUse <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">AWS Compute Optimizer</span> recommendations\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1acb440\" data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"425\">\nAnalyze:\n<ul data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"425\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h2jcg4\" data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"369\">\nCPUUtilization\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"71h28i\" data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"409\">\nMemory usage (via CloudWatch agent)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dm5m3j\" data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"425\">\nNetwork I/O\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"439\"><strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"439\">Actions:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"552\">\n<li data-section-id=\"kkaczj\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"496\">\nDownsize instance types (e.g., <code data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"495\">m5.large → t3.medium</code>)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vwrs4f\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"552\">\nSwitch to burstable (T-series) if workloads are spiky\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"590\"><strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"590\">Automation Tip (Python + Boto3):</strong></p><ul data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"662\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1lzhkhu\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"616\">\nPull CloudWatch metrics\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhskwi\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"662\">\nFlag instances with &lt;20% avg CPU for 7 days\n</li>\n</ul><hr data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\"><h2 data-section-id=\"lt2q4q\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"704\">2. Stop/Terminate Idle Resources</h2><p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"758\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"717\">Problem:</strong> Running unused EC2 = direct cost leakage</p><p data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"774\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"774\">Detection:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"846\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbqpnb\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"790\">\nLow CPU (&lt;5%)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13lj48q\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"811\">\nNo network traffic\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rwmky5\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"846\">\nNo recent login (via CloudTrail)\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"860\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"860\">Actions:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"932\">\n<li data-section-id=\"94k9yr\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"903\">\nStop non-prod instances during off-hours\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"k9zxh3\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"932\">\nTerminate unused instances\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\"><strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\">Best Practice:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h755c0\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"976\">Tag-based automation:</p>\n<pre class=\"overflow-visible! px-0!\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1022\"><div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\"><div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\"><div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl\"><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"pe-11 pt-3\"><div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\"><div id=\"code-block-viewer\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj\"><div class=\"cm-scroller\"><pre class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0\"><code>Environment=Dev<br>AutoStop=True</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1047\">Automation Options:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1107\">\n<li data-section-id=\"axyqg0\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1080\">\nLambda + EventBridge scheduler\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1csrcti\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1107\">\nSSM Automation documents\n</li>\n</ul><hr data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1112\"><h2 data-section-id=\"fhmu5j\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1163\">3. Use Reserved Instances (RI) / Savings Plans</h2><p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1198\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1198\">Best for predictable workloads</strong></p><h3 data-section-id=\"wnggng\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1212\">Options:</h3><ul data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<li data-section-id=\"xl9m97\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1246\">\n<strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1246\">Savings Plans (Recommended)</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5vwbti\" data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1271\">Reserved Instances</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1286\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1286\">Strategy:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1382\">\n<li data-section-id=\"v57m6o\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1313\">\nAnalyze 30–60 days usage\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bs5zei\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1382\">\nCommit for:\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1382\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1e3lht3\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1352\">\n1-year (flexibility)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s493lx\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1382\">\n3-year (max savings ~72%)\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1394\">Tools:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<li data-section-id=\"lyf7sl\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1434\">\n<span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">AWS Cost Explorer</span>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wlg39x\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">AWS Pricing Calculator</span>\n</li>\n</ul><hr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(89, 84, 84); font-family: BMS-Humanity; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.17px;\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><h2 data-section-id=\"10k4d9x\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1530\"></h2><p></p>",
    "textContent": "EC2 Cost Optimization – Practical Guide\n1. Right-Sizing (Highest ROI)\n\nProblem: Over-provisioned instances waste CPU/RAM.\n\nApproach:\n\nUse AWS Compute Optimizer recommendations\nAnalyze:\nCPUUtilization\nMemory usage (via CloudWatch agent)\nNetwork I/O\n\nActions:\n\nDownsize instance types (e.g., m5.large → t3.medium)\nSwitch to burstable (T-series) if workloads are spiky\n\nAutomation Tip (Python + Boto3):\n\nPull CloudWatch metrics\nFlag instances with <20% avg CPU for 7 days\n2. Stop/Terminate Idle Resources\n\nProblem: Running unused EC2 = direct cost leakage\n\nDetection:\n\nLow CPU (<5%)\nNo network traffic\nNo recent login (via CloudTrail)\n\nActions:\n\nStop non-prod instances during off-hours\nTerminate unused instances\n\nBest Practice:\n\nTag-based automation:\n\nEnvironment=Dev\nAutoStop=True\n\nAutomation Options:\n\nLambda + EventBridge scheduler\nSSM Automation documents\n3. Use Reserved Instances (RI) / Savings Plans\n\nBest for predictable workloads\n\nOptions:\nSavings Plans (Recommended)\nReserved Instances\n\nStrategy:\n\nAnalyze 30–60 days usage\nCommit for:\n1-year (flexibility)\n3-year (max savings ~72%)\n\nTools:\n\nAWS Cost Explorer\nAWS Pricing Calculator",
